woken up tired this morning? Many of us are not getting enough sleep every night. In fact, the average American is sleeping one less hour a night than they should. Their body needs more.  Adequate rest is linked to good health. Poor sleep habits contribute to a drop in performance in school and at work."}, {"time": "19500", "image": "", "id": 2, "text": "They have also contributed to accidents, memory loss, mental health problems, physical diseases and weight gain. It is suggested that you go to bed and get up at about the same time each day. Relax for 30 to 60 minutes before going to bed. Avoid alcohol and caffeine within several hours of bedtime."}, {"time": "39000", "image": "", "id": 3, "text": "Are you finding you can't fall asleep? Get out of bed and do something relaxing. Remember, the amount of sunlight exposure you get during the day is vital to your sleep. If you don't get enough, it will be harder for you to fall asleep at night. Have you gotten enough sunlight exposure today?"}], "video_src": "engenn6le08ob01re2vid01"}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "video", "id": 4, "_data": []}]}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa Has a Nightmare"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Are You Getting Enough Sleep?"}, {"type": "position", "content": 1}, {"type": "origin", "content": "scholar > The Inner Mind > Dreams: What Do Yours Mean?"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 8}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le08ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "adequate"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "enough in quantity"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It is important to get adequate rest every day."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob01aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about habits related to sleep."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "health"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the general condition of your body"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The amount of rest you get is critical to good health."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob01aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to avoid"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to stay away from something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You should avoid alcohol."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob01aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "caffeine"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a substance in coffee that makes you feel more active"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Avoid caffeine within several hours before you go to bed."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob01aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bedtime"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the time when you usually go to bed"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You should not drink coffee before bedtime. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob01aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "relaxing"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "making you feel relaxed"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: If you can't fall asleep, do something relaxing."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob01aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "sunlight exposure"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to feel the natural light that comes from the sun on your skin"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Try to get some sunlight exposure every day. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob01aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Simple Present vs. Present Continuous"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use the Simple Present tense and the Present Continuous tenses to talk about the present in different ways."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">Simple Present</span> tense: <ul><li>to talk about things that are always true</li> <li>to give general information</li> <li>to talk about habits and routines</li> <li>feelings (stative verbs)</li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">Present Continuous</span> tense: <ul><li>to talk about an action happening now</li> <li>to talk about things happening around now</li> <li>to talk about things that are changing</li></ul>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Simple Present Tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Present Continuous Tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I sleep for 6 hours every night.<br/>  I read a book before I go to bed. <br/>  I feel tired after I go on a long walk. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm sleeping 7 hours every night now. <br/>  I'm reading a book about the meaning of dreams.<br/>  I'm feeling sleepy. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "We are not getting enough sleep every night. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "The body needs more sleep."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "What have you done?"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">Present Perfect</span> to talk about your experiences or challenges. These actions started in the past, haven't finished or are still related to the present."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Form\\\"}\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Subject<br/>I/you/we/they <br/> He/she</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">+ auxiliary <br/><span class=\\\"strong\\\">have</span> <br/><span class=\\\"strong\\\">has</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">+ <span class=\\\"underline\\\">past participle</span>*</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+ complement\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "* For irregular verbs you use the past participle.<br/>For regular verbs you add <span class=\"italic\">-ed</span> at the end of the verb in infinitive."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Poor sleep habits <span class=\"strong\">have</span> <span class=\"underline\">contributed</span> to a drop in performance at school and at work."}, {"type": "example", "content": "They <span class=\"strong\">have</span> also <span class=\"underline\">contributed</span> to accidents and memory loss."}, {"type": "example", "content": "You <span class=\"strong\">have</span> <span class=\"underline\">gotten</span> enough sleep."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I <span class=\"strong\">have</span> <span class=\"underline\">relaxed</span> for 30 minutes."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "What are your sleep habits?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a list of 5 habits you follow that relate to your sleep."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Then, write down 2 more habits you would like to follow."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Are there any habits you've tried to keep but haven't? What are they?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use all your answers and write a paragraph (8-10 lines)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Proofread your paragraph."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read it aloud to your class."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write about healthy habits."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share my sleep habits."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I discuss habits I've had."}]}]}